# BYOS link redirects: one line per link.
# Format: /path   destination   302
# Always use 302 (temporary) so changes take effect for everyone, even people who clicked before.
# Name links by what they are, never by store, so they still make sense if the store changes.

/go/tote-rack-materials   https://www.homedepot.com/list/view/details/shared/3adc1c80-ba80-11f1-b5f7-e317a781dda0   302

# Fallback: any unknown or retired /go/ link lands on the homepage instead of a 404.
# Keep this line LAST; the first matching line wins.
/go/*   /   302
